Description: what the Haltia programs share (GTK 3)
 haltia_kit holds what the programs of Haltia, a calm touch desktop, have
 in common: large questions, settings, keeping the machine awake while
 something plays, sound through libmpv, photo thumbnails and a viewer,
 secrets in the desktop's keyring.
